"literal>创建派生的<literal>Gtk::TreeModel</literal>，然后覆盖"
"<literal>Gtk::TreeDragSource::row_draggable_vfunc()</literal>和"
"<literal>Gtk::TreeDragDest::row_drop_possible_vfunc()</literal>虚方法。你可以"
"检查提供的<literal>Gtk::TreeModel::Path</literal>并返回<literal>true</"
