#. (itstool) path: chapter/para
#: C/index-in.docbook:4470
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Dialogs are used as secondary windows, to provide specific information or "
#| "to ask questions. <classname>Gtk::Dialog</classname> windows contain a "
#| "few pre-packed widgets to ensure consistency, and a <methodname>run()</"
