msgid ""
"You should avoid cryptic abbreviations, slang, or jargon. They are usually "
"difficult to translate, and are often difficult for even native speakers to "
"understand."
msgstr ""
"你应该避免使用不常见的用于例如缩写、俚语、行话。通常它们对于译者来说很难翻"
