"reference-counting smartpointer. You might be familiar with "
"<classname>std::unique_ptr&lt;&gt;</classname> and "
"<classname>std::shared_ptr&lt;&gt;</classname>, which are also "
"smartpointers. In <application>gtkmm</application>-4.0 "
"<classname>Glib::RefPtr&lt;&gt;</classname> is an alias for "
"<classname>std::shared_ptr&lt;&gt;</classname>, which is reference-counting. "
